# Dark Ritual adds {B}{B}{B} to the pool when it resolves, and mana empties from the pool at the end of every step and
# phase (CR 106.4, 500.4): the three {B} are there in the precombat main phase after the Ritual resolves (net +2 from the
# Swamp's {B}), and gone in the second main phase, so the second Duress cannot be paid for then (the first, cast in the first main phase, is the control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Dark Ritual
Duress
Duress
Swamp x3
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x7
Plains x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}{B}
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
